Note on parametric source vs. exported meshes:
The parametric Blender Python scripts (*.py) that generate the geometry are
licensed under the MIT License (LICENSE-CODE). The exported 3D mesh artifacts
(*.stl, *.3mf) derived from them are licensed under CC-BY-NC-4.0 (LICENSE-DATA)
for open, non-commercial educational and TLM distribution.

